      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The character associates pain with pleasure, typically tied to feeding, and feels shame or self-disgust at the act of drinking blood, resolving it only through suffering.</p><p><strong>Trigger/Effect:</strong> Once wounded past a light injury, the character must win a Willpower test or lose her next action reveling in the pain; healing wounds with blood requires a further, difficult Self-Control test.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
